1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:07,580
AI is advancing quickly. Can the safeguards keep up?

2
00:00:07,580 --> 00:00:15,160
Powerful AI can amplify serious risks. Test before release.

3
00:00:15,160 --> 00:00:22,740
Good intentions are not evidence. Ask an independent reviewer to challenge the evidence.

4
00:00:22,740 --> 00:00:30,220
Monitor after launch. Keep a human ready to pause the system.

5
00:00:30,220 --> 00:00:34,720
AI safeguards need evidence. What should organisations prove before high-risk AI goes live?
